    "source_selector": "[exact Rust token sequence, 1-based occurrence among matching contiguous token sequences in source order]. Ignore whitespace between tokens, but span includes it. Overlapping selectors are legal. Comments/strings are not tokenized as identifier occurrences. Implicit-return selectors anchor the actual tail or closing-brace token.",
